  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place oil, vinegar, salt, and pepper in a medium bowl. Whisk to combine the dressing."
    },
    {
      "text": "Medium dice cheese. Add to the bowl with the dressing."
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash, dry, and halve tomatoes. Add to the bowl."
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash, dry, and pick basil leaves off the stems; roll up crosswise and thinly slice into ribbons. Add to the bowl, then stir to combine the salad."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, divide salad between plates or bowls. Enjoy!"
    }
